msgid "MD Mask Difference (not supported)"
msgstr "MD 마스크 차분 (지원되지 않음)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:68
msgid "NF Noise Filter"
msgstr "NF 노이즈 필터"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:69
msgid "OM Output Packet Mask"
msgstr "OM 출력 패킷 마스크"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:70
msgid "PD Pixel Difference (not supported)"
msgstr "PD 픽셀 차분 (지원되지 않음)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:71
msgid "PF Packet Filter"
msgstr "PF 패킷 필터"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:72
msgid "PM Poll Mode"
msgstr "PM 폴 모드"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:73
msgid "RF Read Frame into Buffer"
msgstr "RF 프레임을 버퍼로 읽기"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:74
msgid "RM Raw Mode"
msgstr "RM 원시 모드"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:75
msgid "RS Reset"
msgstr "RS 리셋"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:76
msgid "SF Send Frame"
msgstr "SF 프레임 전송"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:77
msgid "SM Servo Mask"
msgstr "SM 서보 마스크"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:78
msgid "SO Servo Output"
msgstr "SO 서보 출력"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:79
msgid "SP Servo Parameters"
msgstr "SP 서보 매개변수"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:80
msgid "ST Set Track Command"
msgstr "ST 트랙 설정 명령"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:81
msgid "SV Servo Position"
msgstr "SV 서보 위치"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:82
msgid "TC Track Color"
msgstr "TC 컬러 트래킹"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:83
msgid "TI Track Inverted"
msgstr "TI 반전 트래킹"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:84
msgid "TW Track Window"
msgstr "TW 윈도우 트래킹"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:85
msgid "UD Upload Difference buffer (not supported)"
msgstr "UD 차이 버퍼 업로드 (지원되지 않음)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:86
msgid "VW Virtual Window"
msgstr "VW 가상 윈도우"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:88
msgid "**The following commands will not be supported in the near future:**"
msgstr "**다음 명령들은 가까운 미래에 지원되지 않을 것입니다:**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:90
msgid "CT Set Camera Type"
msgstr "CT 카메라 유형 설정"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:91
msgid "DM Delay Mode"
msgstr "DM 지연 모드"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:92
msgid "L1 Led Control (look at SO instead)"
msgstr "L1 LED 제어 (대신 SO를 참조)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:93
msgid "PS Packet Skip"
msgstr "PS 패킷 스킵"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:94
msgid "SD Sleep Deeply"
msgstr "SD 깊은 절전"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:95
msgid "SL Sleep Command"
msgstr "SL 절전 명령"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:98
msgid "CMUcam2 Emulation Differences"
msgstr "CMUcam2 에뮬레이션 차이점"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:100
msgid "**Servo Input Range**"
msgstr "**서보 입력 범위**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:102
msgid "Servos are now 0-255 8-bit values"
msgstr "서보는 이제 0-255 8비트 값입니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:104
msgid "**Jumpers**"
msgstr "**점퍼**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:106
msgid ""
"Due to the lack of jumpers on the CMUcam3, baud rate and servo direction "
"changes need to be done at compile time - these are controlled by #defines "
"at the top of the cmucam.c source code"
msgstr ""
"CMUcam3에는 점퍼가 없으므로 보드 레이트와 서보 방향 변경은 컴파일 시에 수행해야 합니다 - 이는 cmucam.c 소스 코드 상단의"
" #define으로 제어됩니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:110
msgid "**Set Input (SI** *pin* **) Command**"
msgstr "**Set Input (SI** *pin* **) 명령**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:112
msgid "Sets the *pin* to be an input"
msgstr "*pin*\\ 을 입력으로 설정합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:114
msgid "**Software Color Space (CS** *value* **) Command**"
msgstr "**Software Color Space (CS** *value* **) 명령**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:116
msgid "CS 0 sets the color space to the hardware default (RGB or YCrCb)"
msgstr "CS 0은 색 공간을 하드웨어 기본값(RGB 또는 YCrCb)으로 설정합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:117
msgid "CS 1 does a software conversion to the HSV color space"
msgstr "CS 1은 HSV 색 공간으로 소프트웨어 변환을 수행합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:119
msgid "Conversion assumes hardware is set to RGB for correct results"
msgstr "변환은 올바른 결과를 위해 하드웨어가 RGB로 설정되어 있다고 가정합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:120
msgid ""
"HSV space is an integer space where all values are scaled between 16 and 240"
msgstr "HSV 공간은 모든 값이 16에서 240 사이로 스케일링되는 정수 공간입니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:122
msgid "Note: This is only available in r504 and higher"
msgstr "참고: 이것은 r504 이상에서만 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:124
msgid "**Set Output can control the Blue and Orange LEDs**"
msgstr "**Set Output으로 파란색 및 주황색 LED를 제어할 수 있습니다**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:126
msgid "Servos 2 and 3 will stop working"
msgstr "서보 2와 3이 작동을 멈춥니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:127
msgid "SO 2 1 -> Blue on"
msgstr "SO 2 1 -> 파란색 켜짐"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:128
msgid "SO 2 0 -> Blue off"
msgstr "SO 2 0 -> 파란색 꺼짐"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:129
msgid "SO 3 1 -> Orange on"
msgstr "SO 3 1 -> 주황색 켜짐"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:130
msgid "SO 3 0 -> Orange off"
msgstr "SO 3 0 -> 주황색 꺼짐"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:132
msgid "**No Slave Mode**"
msgstr "**슬레이브 모드 없음**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:134
msgid "It is possible, but we currently don't support it"
msgstr "가능하지만, 현재는 지원하지 않습니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:136
msgid "**Output Mask (OM)**"
msgstr "**출력 마스크 (OM)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:138
msgid "Only supports T and S packets (type 0 and 1)"
msgstr "T 및 S 패킷(유형 0과 1)만 지원"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:140
msgid "**Line Mode (LM)**"
msgstr "**라인 모드 (LM)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:142
msgid "Only supports track color mode (LM 0 1)"
msgstr "컬러 트래킹 모드(LM 0 1)만 지원"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:143
msgid "Track color statistics added in r523 (LM 0 2)"
msgstr "r523에서 추가된 트랙 컬러 통계 (LM 0 2)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:145
msgid "**Send JPEG (SJ)**"
msgstr "**JPEG 전송 (SJ)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:147
msgid "Sends a jpeg compressed frame, header and all"
msgstr "헤더를 포함한 jpeg 압축 프레임을 전송합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:149
msgid "**Demo Mode**"
msgstr "**데모 모드**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:151
msgid ""
"Since holding down the programming button puts the CMUcam3 into programming "
"mode, you need to press the button half a second after startup to enter demo"
" mode"
msgstr ""
"프로그래밍 버튼을 누르고 있으면 CMUcam3가 프로그래밍 모드로 들어가므로, 데모 모드에 진입하려면 시작 후 0.5초 후에 버튼을 "
"눌러야 합니다"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:155
msgid "**Hi-Res Frame Difference**"
msgstr "**고해상도 프레임 차분**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:157
msgid ""
"This now works the same as low-res frame differencing, just at a higher "
"resolution"
msgstr "이것은 이제 더 높은 해상도에서 저해상도 프레임 차분과 동일하게 작동합니다"
